{% comment %}
  Calder Wheels — Fitment Data Provider
  Provides vehicle fitment data to the storefront.

  Two data modes:
    1. LIVE API (primary): The middleware Fitment API server auto-syncs with
       NHTSA and serves live data. Set CALDER_FITMENT_API_URL in theme settings
       or set window.CALDER_FITMENT_API before this renders.
    2. EMBEDDED (fallback): Static JSON for confirmed vehicles generated from
       the client-supplied SUV Fitment Guide. The API is the primary source;
       this fallback ensures basic SUV vehicle coverage when the API is unreachable.

  To regenerate embedded data:
     cd fitment && python export_fitment_data.py --db fitment.db --liquid ../shopify/snippets/fitment-data.liquid

  Vehicle statuses:
    CONFIRMED = inventory exists (PCD + hub + offset match)
    PENDING_CONFIRMATION = awaiting client response on inventory coverage

  Current confirmed vehicles embedded below for API-unavailable fallback.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign fitment_api_url = settings.fitment_api_url | default: 'https://calder-dev.covedigitalworks.com'
  assign configurator_api_url = settings.configurator_api_url | default: 'https://calder-dev.covedigitalworks.com'
-%}

<script>
  window.CALDER_FITMENT_API = '{{ fitment_api_url }}';
  window.CALDER_API_BASE = '{{ configurator_api_url }}';
</script>

